<title>USA: TABLE- Woolworth June same-store sales down.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Woolworth June same-store sales down.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		 $681	 $708	-3.8	 -3.1</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $2,971     $3,044	-2.4	 -2.7</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   five weeks ended	  July 5.</p>
<p>Full company name is Woolworth Corp</p>
<p>The company said that excluding the effect of translation rates, particularly as it relates to its German operations, sales for the five week period decreased 0.7 percent.</p>
<p>Sales for the 22 week period increased 0.4 percent on the same basis.</p>
<p>((---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
